      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The tiapride, usually prescribed in neurologic pathology, has been used in ENT carcinoma pain. On 30 cases of this study, we got 18 good results, that means a decrease of the pain in 60% cases. In all the cases, the tiapride was well tolerated."},
